---
// Converted from Template/changelog.html (section_changelog)
---

<section class="section_changelog">
  <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container">
    <div class="changelog-list">
      <div page-load-4="" class="changelog-item">
        <div class="changelog-meta">
          <div class="changelog-badge">Version 1.0.0</div>
          <div class="text-size-small">October 27, 2026</div>
        </div>
        <div class="changelog-body">
          <h2 class="heading-style-4">Initial Release</h2>
          <p class="text-size-regular">The first public release of AlphaWave, a recruitment and hiring agency theme for Astro with a Strapi CMS. Everything is built with CSS variables, reusable Astro components and attribute-based animations.</p>
          <ul role="list" class="utility-list">
            <li class="utility-list-item">Static pages: Home, About, Services, Jobs, Blogs and Contact, plus the Style Guide, Licenses, Instructions, Changelog, Password and 404 utility pages.</li>
            <li class="utility-list-item">Strapi collections with detail pages: Blog Posts, Services and Jobs (with Companies), plus demo content and a seed script.</li>
            <li class="utility-list-item">Astro components for the Header, Footer, CTA, buttons and blog, job and service cards.</li>
            <li class="utility-list-item">Color, spacing, radius and typography variables with responsive modes for every breakpoint.</li>
            <li class="utility-list-item">Contact and newsletter forms with styled labels, focus states and success and error messages, ready for any form endpoint.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
